{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 649,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b748a89f96939ea4f6140590",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛中强者云集，你有多少自信呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf102b0760297210a7307a66fb33e88da71cd96bc694c6417e1e478ca18a74c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:538f0e01c3c62fe458db54b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有在竞赛中发挥出如预期般的表现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6d424e7e6006f28c33596050656507f9ecade9287bc76ab5963706eadcf6b8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "406"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5322a16cfbc3711b41426fa2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你似乎在训练时重新检视了自己跑法对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "06a47c7f44755fa2e4152d99f59b10e70861ffd3bd3129ba54bc8d1f03267524",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "407"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e1b2a0e0b6bdd51566fcd0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你那充满爆发力的赛况，太令人感动了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "826059428a808904d13abe1aee977db466c3a79b21aa79179241b884c1e46c9c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "408"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed020ea543ae8de860e9e190",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "除了获胜之外还有哪些收获？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee9fb572ecf28b7758a36f1dc544912e4b7b092609de410f7f4fee6d179311d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf7556368f0d4a5a33312b26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完全是能形容为「电光石火」的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8b95aca4e03fc0315e3b9650a5bce0599838551656025de8286bfb1fce2559a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:983bf52562f748b3294e46a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下场比赛会采取什么样的作战？",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ad9497ef4a7dabb3ef35d0ea001c5af0d7a8da33f70740b120cd2091d9db40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "410"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5964bea48290d76f39f4b9e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "称霸激烈的比赛并获得胜利，太精彩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac88303109553d75584ce3e0bd40cfb023a6010dd853548106932993bdfb7f86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0182d375b0979d0e589e6147",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "接下来最想先做什么事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde23a6c1d6cdcae5b5b613f74f2a5a1720d0f8f6ca6778aed45bfc9b015ffd3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f7a47915f6da71208310c8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我们都很期待你的下一场竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c2b5bf48a66a450b4955bae8f9f65457c72ee086eb28afb203f496b11c9f44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "413"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f23486faf4170107d1fe6092",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以预见决赛时会聚集更多的强敌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0173c736b29597ea9675e440991360bd7b5c1e269c845501883708661123d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "414"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397331622544327f78cd7e44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会针对决赛特地去吃「致胜料理」吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e57567e8face532bb1b30cac81763943187365222b4778a6aaa9b2fbaf16e11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "415"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8bf303a0a1361ac58f8f01c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请针对决赛说说你的抱负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b8909cb979778ac43ca869bad5125b818db7ce025ce9f9c1d9d1b913373ade",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "416"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11fdcf240b6bcd9f4543d3e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练时会特别注重什么吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a466a12127975df8438610b71bd25286a1be4122aa220e3c446cb8911bcc8a13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "417"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a28345e01f4568119dc8b657",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和训练员开了什么样的作战会议？",
      "source_fingerprint": "975076c88f73bfeddc1603c71093d812f26662d336744a0f02b5c16d4c8052e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "418"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6192356c4317ba468b187d3a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想必接下来的竞赛对手会越来越强吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0de076c3a77b5bb699000fef645b19176ffa2b4268886da900709b4ce6aecbe8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "419"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:989f99c37700615bd7fe29f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛时，会注重些什么事呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1c10f9a6051e24fdd11142a94c7cced0b1e1b59c52b9d8acb98b1c748e32bb8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d3b1176dd58bf0683d17015",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一下子就好，可以请你把面罩脱掉吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be0da9d64a32b978b2600ca30c19954b0dec5319a937dce7540263f54d7cdf1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:832b841fc10a038647f6d57e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝们说句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d15f6fdfced58652fbc9e3a2f8e7c128e170e92e9d1e781004a50c8ef3855ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf27e9f1f21c4452a14a79d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来下次也会成为一场热血的对决呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d56fd0bdcd8c1e4e83ca22a11fc5c46c8f274b2624163bfa4b8f50d62a2e7cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "422"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef61e93a0e310deccf70ef5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问成为你致胜关键的料理是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "632f9a50aa74df9680d1e364094117aca8a517ee215de1907cd0159b5fa53a83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "423"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:423e481db3e6b186912cc11c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们在竞赛上吸引众人目光的技巧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb345a2b0e0f7a48b53721d6e41e04b4028119405fa136aaba11b19f0074b5fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "424"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c00d521a8e74e514890e31c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你认为自己与对手们的差别在于？",
      "source_fingerprint": "17e7309c9a98accc24a7161089ea48d7131fbee81a5727ba6aac50efd9a670cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "425"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efdc94adc2f4207bc24c40b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的表现就宛如捕捉猎物时的猛禽一般……",
      "source_fingerprint": "88ab1b5cfc3ce6f7b84e2e93b6c282e71f53e9b2d6b740684c56e58ebc77b573",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "426"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36d7b54d9cb22ac0dc097848",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也有意见表示期待你们两姐妹在决赛对决喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0350c7ff94863a869d41e60c3794a79bba8d04e724d99b86a6d33ec91096c783",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "427"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8aee4e2f725d7d2cf56b4a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你会中意「怪物」这个别称吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b1b7a4e6c757c4a6de377bf1e5ae03a18c16f8132c51149cddffe8e854ca208",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "428"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7f74d105416f646650f44cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你抵达终点瞬间的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c345c2f52b1e6bedfbacee49b896841a12e066f5d700ee76293697e8369d693",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "429"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed38e30ee99471f81098f11f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请针对今天的竞赛发表感言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1516de24f975bb2efc48a659772b39c274a075ebecb5d13fd8c0aaeb0b71fe86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cac349e6d0bbd0e789f6c29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下场竞赛该关注的对手是谁？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7f3fa6082c37050ea97c4f82eefd831e1898077521e05a6888656856c71e383",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "430"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f02cb03f7d5efc85d929af6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有什么决定性的致胜手段吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "76386eab3f1deb47ba79436098f11c7321b02f84793698c242e866a8bd6c1e9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bcc4094881ef86c46cd8459",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那压倒性的表现，真是令人畏惧的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e61bc0d35f6292808278b34431ac989eddd2def445886b208d0b11e59d5c8fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "432"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61b4b008e31c09598f27820e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这正是能配得上「女帝」之名的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ffb3df7d1b5c7f8305b0438c55acd7b7514281ac23c56dd1ee7949b2e129111",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "433"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:859b3f3a8785d79099e222d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对数度激烈交锋的竞赛对手说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1b3ba8ccaa0b61b20bec13e3d086ebe973e78491adc5e23e4ee6a904ac6418c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "434"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:425ae85ba62ab40274784baa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每天都会做哪些训练？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a4ce6f6d1a92737e34d53ae6232dda266bfac6b6a0fca96f73e69f7a6110cb2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "435"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3837b58b90a5e9054c195e66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在下场竞赛来临前，打算怎么度过？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad870105e8331346fbb5865f200d66a0322266c3363dd5d1e527a6cb7e9a718",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "436"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4db27b04043a92463f60f06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1398b3629ec121af8bef36cb0d63fda7a0ddfc5fdf5ca6d5c069bc57053bd1cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "437"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e258f103f4451948dcf8c39f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家的目光都集中在你的精彩表现上呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "515138b19e0e701bebb40418a0150f691296abfdfdf4609a0f5cc772998e40f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "438"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b6bd88da1eaa83122071362",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5af0f64085ff6426a046679705388129f151c4ca7bad839a95ba1f0a10f1be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "439"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13522684895c889e4803186a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "殿下，这是场很出色的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b267dd258cab5ec877b8c6b23f9661f17ab12d2fc84e6e3cdac3f00e6614a22",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bfe5129507f444ed69176b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问致胜关键是什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "99bc62e29330fa24ded2717da2ea26d66745fd0e4da36cb75f03eaf0d201faeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "440"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb7b1bb8c301ae2d74852b87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「白色雷电」……的表现，还能继续期待吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "150ff6806b852379e562d2eb5969c70d4d3067aa8a3393e0018f83cece9af528",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c70da06edfc21a3eb79ee4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对下场比赛的对手说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aeb4cfb691231007ae78fa8cccf6cca67a6fdeb4a8e1d326c5ceaedf5337834",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "442"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27ba52dcf9df3db0cd367c9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有特别注意哪位决赛时的对手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d87f6885dd99f1ac2f95c0f9265b852e851a76b1df3d5dd1d9877cb788dabd0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "443"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56d1b82cfd62d59149b79a04",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛前有做些什么来祈求好运吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea3f925d00357a8663971a655bb115703222336f2c0cf3b0b7a3c5a1af4407c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "444"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f08cdf2f4ddd38e7259c03db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会想将这次的胜利传达给谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3aacf7bd22d81aedb86e65ffa6085109bbf8dbd7b49e803fc91b716666e2f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "445"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a783f51bc3fd644e472d384",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会吃哪种特殊的拉面来庆祝胜利？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e9dbdc5cd49140f57207b362ddf42373f95a4bad9524df1dae8ce9a55409cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "446"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b02b13be45826c9322db533",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好像很喜欢吃香蕉呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28259137bccb4c5039f3cab1b271cbfb35e658ae91d2bce54b9d425930e78233",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "447"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ad9e11527337e49bec639a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在竞赛中让眼镜不会掉下来的秘诀是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff27cbc7ce4f3cedc6abf5bf80407ec83ea0e35e60e81beddd52847f5df6f96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "448"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a4d2abf4342ff5183b0fffd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关于这次的竞赛，有什么话想对妹妹说？",
      "source_fingerprint": "549ac9b606078c25dbf0d7c127dae9589b2e7461820ce853643ec0bf2de5509d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "449"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae72c0874cbe4a5c1f8d7a6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你表现得威风凛凛呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "097780b029983a59f4a1a9f4d201a213ae49cd3356e7a964dad90e0fb1fb61e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "45"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1eb5b0b3a470cd9195a39b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以预见决赛时会有更激烈的战况吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54192323b34dd03631c7adf492e0fbd97767cc9c5f670cd065dbb161487fccb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "450"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:777c3e5a9e0a817a878f98b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面对下场比赛，你现在的状态如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0083137408c9fa8073bfb8dbed5b8376520717be4d0776270e13367f40a0d8d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa5c0ae3b23d75cfb91c13f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得决赛的胜算有多少……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36bbb197db1329cc40aed505c3c2cea7f2d2644ae2a30b008613c958d2572d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "452"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29e6a0a1286c0e1c12d09f14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请直白地告诉我们，获胜的原因是什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "37952da99db907b3cd5d5212b8d1f61abc28842a3ef4d6389d6b653d27e38b85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "453"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37f9d41b96b64d4a480c70d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做了什么样的准备来面对下场比赛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d4fa2e898a3d5b686c00b97a80c208998f7ca64e97d3e909ad0b2b7b2489a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "454"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ad87c3c419416f463fefe1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "脑中已经有获得优胜时的印象了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e251e9e32f41c7c5d2084709545c95d817f23d9925171809e6ee906b0ba6f1d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "455"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ec0da844b53cb007e9d5444",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前会补充什么样的燃料？",
      "source_fingerprint": "54865f4e0412e46e314efe1cb704436be35bb8a17ca0eb7063577f4bc8b61a76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "456"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f8bef48735a78abfaf4b49e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好惊人的表现……难道你真的是赛博格？",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f97cf01b36e72854e42f041fcdcf148b4da9a301fcea47e81f8d17682a0e5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "457"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdc4fa310a1c437282fb62b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如同「超特急」般的表现太精彩了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "328f722939c2093fa199533ad74fc83ff0f427aed3181f6c0cf513d7cfb16286",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "458"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb8d90256b65664aceac380",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有预计会针对决赛来强化自己吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f91c8299afd411ac423daaacf584107d22c2ccfb0b61bb8af0b59a47ea42f130",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "459"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f2b298b47bdef3cbc69241",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你对发质保养相当讲究吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d51435f1a909d63ed11a997560cc6c8409b1651aba1ca4e4648fc3e483677e49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08f1d332c64886c7f6ad7bb5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是场相当激烈的竞赛，会感到疲累吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a67709e660f842b043741daec8a8186a74793c14db36e0cbd2ae589727823c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "460"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:429611f2fc8b4413ff69743f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对下场比赛的劲敌们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e32610bcce81c51c76c2c3dde0f2756e73043920658f8d1a42093c69129a5d14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efa6c14a7901e284dc1d36e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是看了就令人为之兴奋的震撼表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16314c9b40caa07c537fdaf61b0ed2d2e821adca3d982f74f543dafba9ac93a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "462"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e62d1faaa0066828147f36a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你为了大赛下了特别的工夫！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "786f71f49445bef2c469d4ad7875c8eba7a99e37ada7b84d9060e52d05094bac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "463"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd5f9bb15af0e6063c20e0f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5af0f64085ff6426a046679705388129f151c4ca7bad839a95ba1f0a10f1be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "464"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5456a708fab301fc3a6845a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是相当耀眼的精彩表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c49463d42c532d51e5f057a654d3f329d6e43931a1de0a191d6d3f26d2711267",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "465"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5a837b12ddd302e28175173",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛时似乎会遇到更强的对手喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "242583cf602fa044fbe1fc74fedbc71f67ac77d643e8d9a2fc34b70e0b0aa693",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "466"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929f5bd6bc01d928839e0f2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你刚才似乎跟观众席的人说了些什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b43e2c74ae055b31125d1c3e876c0a6c3eb9a3a955af61a5a278aea98c409c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "467"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ca2453d55e130accf43fb73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在决赛时也能期待你的表现对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "322b3540860ca3ff963115fa1a84318df86fec4cef78756387bf0d6636883420",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "468"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c6a331f3edd2577481ee2f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问你是以什么样的心情面对竞赛呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6133b20bd3e3181212803df5b57a1e9cea595b36fbc5589ffc166b34b17e632d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "469"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250db96a50f679c91ec7dd27",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "重炮选手的飞行真了不起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9403c25dab5938a8108ece5ddad9b21b0b51f8ffccba5f17dace62c04dbac034",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ee55f3b85b485c1181798d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的致胜料理果然是会吃饭吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bae6f9927ac2b654356259a7e56fcfa1609e63956c9a9dcf27c54479e3614c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "470"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fe8f2d3b1aab47476360bb2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以让我们拍一张获胜的纪念照吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c38d61352e60487369c3d567b0ade3fa6461668b0381448dbf6b6938af60ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6229b09aa9851bea7b55b943",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面对决赛时的压力会很大吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b548b7412c5410c52bc6f937df33a1aabd8ada6f0f215cdfb07224da096a17bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "472"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c3275e169447d4b9254fc3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对决赛的劲敌发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "074544c32f79f0321e54dacf6cdc398fad3c8cb22f4fea039e7e30b3bab79ebd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "473"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f00b105803b6b36e96e8d08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你对于下场比赛的抱负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fede3e3f600c7943b09f52e254b414d137badde58a6fbc81f60a2449102055a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "474"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284ee2dfa8826737aeb8f912",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宛如音速般身处异次元的表现耶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b8b300df879146eac3cb8b4c35119d350fd7ac6dbf0870cfeecf3d62d3a1b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "475"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ddee9bf5742712109324f74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请向粉丝发表你的感想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a70fc7e309deeab90c84b20a0c26f10a36695edf2a4c0d9644b68c80cb13791",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "476"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc5229799bbac58ebf38c08e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请跟竞赛对手说些你的感想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e952b6da26243abbce38d3c4623085056a2e9c5bff14255c3b23edfa9d0759cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
